<title>UK: LME COPPER SLIDES IN PM, ZINC SPREAD FLARES.</title>
<headline>LME COPPER SLIDES IN PM, ZINC SPREAD FLARES.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Weaker, slides below $2,300, finds support at $2,280.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Off lows after correction, moves up to probe $1,750 area.</p>
<p>Cash/threes at $11/$15 backwardation.</p>
<p>ZINC - Three months little changed, but cash/threes flare to $130/$150</p>
<p>backwardation. LEAD - Slightly weaker.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Soft after falling to $7,000. TIN - Probes $5,600.</p>
</text>
